 belongs to Carol V.; the platform export does not establish ownership.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-report-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/report/paragraph-3"}]},{"relationship_id":"rel-witness-carla-redfox","subject_entity_id":"ent-person-carla-v","predicate":"reported_controls_handle","object_entity_id":"ent-handle-redfox","status":"suspected","statement":"The witness says RedFox may refer to Carla V. and does not claim to have seen a verified account-owner record.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-witness-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/paragraph-1"}]},{"relationship_id":"rel-carol-denies-message-knowledge","subject_entity_id":"ent-person-carol-v","predicate":"denies_knowledge_of_message","object_entity_id":"ent-message-m77","status":"reported","statement":"The supplied profile excerpt using the display name Carol V. contains a sentence denying knowledge of the RedFox message; authentication to the platform account is not established.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-profile-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/profile/carol-v"}]}],"unknown_counterpart_gaps":[{"gap_id":"gap-redfox-controller","derivation":"explicit_source","known_entity_id":"ent-handle-redfox","predicate_or_participant_role":"controller/owner","missing_role":"object","description":"The platform export confirms handle presence but its account identifier and ownership fields are redacted, so the person controlling RedFox is unresolved.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-platform-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/platform/handle-export/redfox"}]},{"gap_id":"gap-message-sender","derivation":"explicit_source","known_entity_id":"ent-message-m77","predicate_or_participant_role":"sender","missing_role":"participant","description":"The packet does not establish which entity sent message M-77.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-message-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/message/metadata/message-77"},{"source_id":"c-platform-002","source_locator":"case-c-scale/platform/request/account-mapping"}]}],"missing_evidence":[{"gap_id":"gap-platform-ownership-record","derivation":"frozen_case_mandate","description":"Obtain and verify platform account records mapping RedFox to an account identifier and ownership or registration details.","known_entity_ids":["ent-handle-redfox"]},{"gap_id":"gap-reliable-send-metadata","derivation":"frozen_case_mandate","description":"Obtain reliable platform send metadata for message M-77 to assess the conflicting incident-time claims.","known_entity_ids":["ent-message-m77"]}],"missing_information":[{"gap_id":"gap-exact-message-time","derivation":"explicit_source","description":"The exact sent-at time for message M-77 is unresolved because the metadata provides only a collection-side timestamp and the available accounts give incompatible approximate or reported times.","known_entity_ids":["ent-message-m77"],"context_event_ids":["evt-redfox-message"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-message-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/message/metadata/message-77"},{"source_id":"c-chronology-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/chronology-review"}]},{"gap_id":"gap-identity-resolution","derivation":"explicit_source","description":"Whether Carol V. and Carla V. are aliases for one person or distinct individuals remains unresolved.","known_entity_ids":["ent-person-carol-v","ent-person-carla-v"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-analyst-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/coreference-note"},{"source_id":"c-alias-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/alias-table"}]}],"conflicts":[{"conflict_id":"conf-identity-redfox","description":"The first report attributes RedFox to Carol V., while the witness says RedFox may refer to Carla V.; the platform export does not resolve ownership.","relationship_assertion_ids":["rel-report-carol-redfox","rel-witness-carla-redfox"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-report-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/report/paragraph-3"},{"source_id":"c-witness-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/paragraph-1"},{"source_id":"c-platform-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/platform/handle-export/redfox"}]},{"conflict_id":"conf-chronology-redfox-message","description":"The first report gives 2026-03-01 10:00 UTC, while the witness recalls approximately 2026-03-01 11:00 UTC; the chronology review requires the discrepancy to remain visible.","event_ids":["evt-redfox-message"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-report-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/report/paragraph-3"},{"source_id":"c-witness-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/paragraph-1"},{"source_id":"c-chronology-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/chronology-review"}]},{"conflict_id":"conf-profile-denial-versus-attribution","description":"A profile excerpt using the display name Carol V. denies knowledge of the RedFox message, while the first report attributes the RedFox handle to Carol V.; the profile is not authenticated to the platform account, so the claims are not resolved.","relationship_assertion_ids":["rel-report-carol-redfox","rel-carol-denies-message"],"source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-report-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/report/paragraph-3"},{"source_id":"c-profile-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/profile/carol-v"}]}],"warnings":["The platform export confirms handle presence but not ownership.","The 2026-03-01 11:02 UTC message timestamp is a collection-side timestamp and must not be substituted for incident time.","The 2026-03-04 15:20 UTC preservation-log timestamp is a collection timestamp, not message-send time.","Carol V. and Carla V. are preserved as separate source-linked entities with unresolved coreference.","The unrelated maintenance log was not used to resolve identity or chronology."]}